source: crates/hub/tests/explain.rs
expression: report
---
session by hash
Nested Loop
  Index Scan using sessions_pkey on sessions [Index Cond: ((session_hash)::bytea = ?::bytea)]
  Index Scan using users_pkey on users [Index Cond: ((tid = s.user_tid) AND (oid = s.user_oid))]

user by key
Index Scan using users_pkey on users [Index Cond: ((tid = ?::text) AND (oid = ?::text))]
